Kasir), tidak peduli kolom mana yang dipilih di atas — kolom di atas cuma menentukan kolom TAMBAHAN mana yang ikut diisi. Bisa diedit lagi per produk kapan saja.</div>\n    </div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-full btn-sm u-mb10\" data-action=\"previewImportKatalog\">🔍 Pratinjau</button>\n    <div id=\"importKatalogPreview\" style=\"max-height:40vh;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:14px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" id=\"importKatalogCommitBtn\" data-action=\"commitImportKatalog\" disabled>✅ Import Semua ke Etalase</button>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"goldImportModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"goldImportModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"goldImportModal-title\"><span>🥇 Impor Nota Emas (Massal)</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"goldImportModal\"]' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Tempel isi nota emas di bawah — bisa beberapa nota sekaligus, PISAHKAN tiap nota dengan 1 baris kosong. Sertakan info kadar (mis. \"750\"), berat (mis. \"B: 4.130 g\"), harga per gram (mis. \"@755\") dan/atau total (mis. \"JUMLAH 3.118.000\"), serta tanggal & nama kalau ada. Semua otomatis masuk ke Buku Aset dengan kategori Emas/Logam Mulia & tercentang \"Hitung ke Zakat Maal\".</div>\n    <input type=\"file\" id=\"goldImportXLSXFile\" accept=\".xlsx,.xls\" class=\"u-dnone\" onchange=\"GoldImport.importXLSXFile(event)\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-full btn-sm u-mb10\" data-action=\"GoldImport.openXLSXPicker\">📥 Upload Rekap Nota (.xlsx)</button>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Atau Tempel Isi Nota (teks)</label><textarea class=\"fi\" id=\"goldImportText\" style=\"min-height:200px\" placeholder=\"Pekalongan, 18-7-2020\nNama: Alina\n1 pt cincin plat model AD Rose + putih\n750\nB: 4.130 g\n@755\nJUMLAH 3.118.000\n\nPekalongan, 21/07/2020\nNama: Wisnu\n1 pt Lt susup AD (K)\n750\nB: 2.050 gr\n@735\nJUMLAH 1.507.000\"></textarea></div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-full btn-sm u-mb10\" data-action=\"previewGoldImport\">🔍 Pratinjau</button>\n    <div id=\"goldImportPreview\" style=\"max-height:40vh;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:14px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" id=\"goldImportCommitBtn\" data-action=\"commitGoldImport\" disabled>✅ Impor Semua ke Buku Aset</button>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"goldZakatModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"goldZakatModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"goldZakatModal-title\"><span>🕌 Analisa Emas & Zakat</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"goldZakatModal\"]' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div id=\"goldZakatBody\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"importShopExcelModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"importShopExcelModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"importShopExcelModal-title\"><span>📥 Import dari Excel (Shop)</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"importShopExcelModal\"]' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Pilih data yang mau diisi, lalu upload file .xlsx. Cara paling gampang: pakai file hasil \"📤 Export Excel\" dari tab yang sama sebagai template, edit/tambah barisnya, lalu upload lagi di sini. Produk/produsen yang namanya sudah ada otomatis di-update, yang belum ada otomatis dibuat baru.</div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Import Ke</label>\n      <div class=\"u-flex u-gap8\" id=\"importShopExcelTargetToggle\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn active u-flex1\" id=\"importShopExcelTargetEtalase\" data-action=\"setImportShopExcelTarget\" data-args='[\"etalase\",\"$el\"]'>📦 Etalase Produk</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn u-flex1\" id=\"importShopExcelTargetProdusen\" data-action=\"setImportShopExcelTarget\" data-args='[\"produsen\",\"$el\"]'>🏭 Produsen</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">File Excel (.xlsx)</label><input type=\"file\" class=\"fi\" id=\"importShopExcelFile\" accept=\".xlsx,.xls\" onchange=\"onImportShopExcelFileChange(event)\"></div>\n    <div id=\"importShopExcelPreview\" style=\"max-height:40vh;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:14px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" id=\"importShopExcelCommitBtn\" data-action=\"commitImportShopExcel\" disabled>✅ Import Semua</button>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"shopCsvImportModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"shopCsvImportModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"shopCsvImportModal-title\"><span>📊 Import CSV (Etalase)</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args=\'[\"shopCsvImportModal\"]\' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Upload file .csv dengan header kolom: <b>nama,kategori,harga_beli,harga_jual,stok,satuan</b> (urutan kolom bebas, kolom \"nama\" wajib ada). Produk yang namanya sudah ada di Etalase otomatis di-update, yang belum ada otomatis dibuat baru.</div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">File CSV</label><input type=\"file\" class=\"fi\" id=\"shopCsvImportFile\" accept=\".csv,text/csv\" onchange=\"onShopCsvImportFileChange(event)\"></div>\n    <div id=\"shopCsvImportPreview\" style=\"max-height:40vh;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:14px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" id=\"shopCsvImportCommitBtn\" data-action=\"commitShopCsvImport\" disabled>✅ Import Semua ke Etalase</button>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"sparepartCsvImportModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"sparepartCsvImportModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"sparepartCsvImportModal-title\"><span>📊 Import CSV (Kategori)</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args=\'[\"sparepartCsvImportModal\"]\' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Upload file .csv dengan header kolom: <b>nama,kode,interval_km,tampil_reminder</b> (urutan kolom bebas, kolom \"nama\" wajib ada). Kategori yang namanya sudah ada otomatis di-update, yang belum ada otomatis dibuat baru. Kolom tampil_reminder isi ya/tidak (opsional).</div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">File CSV</label><input type=\"file\" class=\"fi\" id=\"sparepartCsvImportFile\" accept=\".csv,text/csv\" onchange=\"onSparepartCsvImportFileChange(event)\"></div>\n    <div id=\"sparepartCsvImportPreview\" style=\"max-height:40vh;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:14px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" id=\"sparepartCsvImportCommitBtn\" data-action=\"commitSparepartCsvImport\" disabled>✅ Import Semua ke Kategori Sparepart</button>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"shopPdfImportModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"shopPdfImportModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"shopPdfImportModal-title\"><span>📄 Import PDF Katalog Supplier</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"shopPdfImportModal\"]' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Upload 1 atau BANYAK PDF katalog supplier sekaligus — teks tiap file dibaca otomatis (OCR dipakai kalau halamannya hasil scan/gambar). Format per baris: \"Nama Produk[spasi/tab]Rp30.000\" atau \"Nama Produk 60rb\". Cek & sesuaikan hasilnya di bawah, centang yang mau diimpor, baru tap \"Import\".</div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Isi Harga ke Kolom</label>\n      <div class=\"u-flex u-gap8\" id=\"shopPdfImportTargetToggle\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn active u-flex1\" id=\"shopPdfImportTargetBeli\" data-action=\"ShopPdfImportUI.setTarget\" data-args='[\"beli\",\"$el\"]'>💰 Harga Beli</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn u-flex1\" id=\"shopPdfImportTargetJual\" data-action=\"ShopPdfImportUI.setTarget\" data-args='[\"jual\",\"$el\"]'>🏷️ Harga Jual</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.5\">💡 PDF katalog supplier biasanya daftar harga BELI (bukan harga jual ke konsumen) — default \"Harga Beli\", ganti ke \"Harga Jual\" kalau memang PDF-nya daftar harga jual.</div>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"file\" accept=\"application/pdf\" multiple class=\"u-dnone\" id=\"shopPdfImportFile\" onchange=\"ShopPdfImportUI.onFileChange(event)\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-full btn-sm u-mb10\" data-action=\"ShopPdfImportUI.pickFile\">📄 Pilih File PDF (bisa lebih dari 1)</button>\n    <div id=\"shopPdfImportStatus\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.5\"></div>\n    <div id=\"shopPdfImportPreview\" style=\"max-height:40vh;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:14px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" id=\"shopPdfImportCommitBtn\" data-action=\"ShopPdfImportUI.commit\" disabled>✅ Import yang Dicentang</button>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"shopScanModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"shopScanModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"shopScanModal-title\"><span>📷 Scan Nota/Struk Supplier</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"shopScanModal\"]' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Foto 1 struk/nota supplier sekali jalan — teksnya dibaca otomatis (OCR). Format per baris: \"Nama Produk[spasi/tab]Rp30.000\" atau \"Nama Produk 60rb\". Cek & sesuaikan hasilnya di bawah, centang yang mau diimpor, baru tap \"Import\".</div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Isi Harga ke Kolom</label>\n      <div class=\"u-flex u-gap8\" id=\"shopScanTargetToggle\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn active u-flex1\" id=\"shopScanTargetBeli\" data-action=\"ShopScanUI.setTarget\" data-args='[\"beli\",\"$el\"]'>💰 Harga Beli</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn u-flex1\" id=\"shopScanTargetJual\" data-action=\"ShopScanUI.setTarget\" data-args='[\"jual\",\"$el\"]'>🏷️ Harga Jual</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.5\">💡 Struk/nota supplier biasanya daftar harga BELI (bukan harga jual ke konsumen) — default \"Harga Beli\", ganti ke \"Harga Jual\" kalau memang notanya daftar harga jual.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm u-flex1\" data-action=\"ShopScanUI.scanCamera\">📷 Scan Kamera</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm u-flex1\" data-action=\"ShopScanUI.scanGallery\">🖼️ Scan dari Galeri</button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"shopScanStatus\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.5\"></div>\n    <div id=\"shopScanPreview\" style=\"max-height:40vh;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:14px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" id=\"shopScanCommitBtn\" data-action=\"ShopScanUI.commit\" disabled>✅ Import yang Dicentang</button>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"shopJsonModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"shopJsonModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"shopJsonModal-title\"><span>🗂️ Import/Export JSON (Shop)</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"shopJsonModal\"]' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Backup/restore cepat khusus data Shop (Etalase Produk + Produsen) — tidak perlu buka Backup Data biasa & centang/uncentang modul lain.</div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14 u-mb10\" data-action=\"ShopJsonIO.exportJSON\">📤 Export JSON (Etalase + Produsen)</button>\n    <div class=\"div\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Mode Import</label>\n      <div class=\"u-flex u-gap8\" id=\"shopJsonImportModeToggle\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn active u-flex1\" id=\"shopJsonModeGabung\" data-action=\"ShopJsonIO.setMode\" data-args='[\"gabung\",\"$el\"]'>🔀 Gabung</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn u-flex1\" id=\"shopJsonModeTimpa\" data-action=\"ShopJsonIO.setMode\" data-args='[\"timpa\",\"$el\"]'>♻️ Timpa</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.5\" id=\"shopJsonModeHint\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">File JSON</label><input type=\"file\" class=\"fi\" id=\"shopJsonImportFile\" accept=\".json,application/json\" onchange=\"onShopJsonImportFileChange(event)\"></div>\n    <div id=\"shopJsonImportPreview\" style=\"max-height:40vh;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:14px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" id=\"shopJsonImportCommitBtn\" data-action=\"commitShopJsonImport\" disabled>✅ Import</button>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"mergeProductModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"mergeProductModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"mergeProductModal-title\"><span>🔗 Gabungkan Harga Produk</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"mergeProductModal\"]' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Pilih 2 produk atau lebih yang mau disamakan harganya. Setelah digabung, tiap kali harga salah satu produk diubah lewat menu Edit, produk lain dalam grup ini otomatis ikut berubah — tidak perlu edit satu-satu lagi.</div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"fi\" id=\"mergeProductSearch\" placeholder=\"Cari nama produk...\" oninput=\"Etalase.renderMergeList()\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n    <div id=\"mergeProductList\" style=\"max-height:45vh;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:12px\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:sticky;bottom:0;background:var(--surface);border-top:1px solid var(--border2);padding-top:10px;margin-top:4px\">\n      <div class=\"fg u-mb10\" id=\"mergeProductPriceWrap\" style=\"display:none\">\n        <label class=\"fl\">Harga Jual Gabungan (Rp)</label>\n        <div class=\"amt-wrap\">\n          <input type=\"text\" class=\"fi fi-calc-only\" id=\"mergeProductPrice\" placeholder=\"0\" inputmode=\"decimal\" onblur=\"evalAmtExpr('mergeProductPrice')\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"calc-trigger\" data-action=\"openCalc\" data-args='[\"mergeProductPrice\"]' title=\"Buka kalkulator\" aria-label=\"Buka kalkulator\">🧮</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:600\" id=\"mergeProductPreviewText\">Pilih minimal 2 produk</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" id=\"mergeProductConfirmBtn\" data-action=\"Etalase.confirmMerge\" disabled>🔗 Gabungkan Harga</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"billMultiScanModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"billMultiScanModal-title\" style=\"z-index:300\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"billMultiScanModal-title\"><span>📋 Scan Rincian Tagihan</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"billMultiScanModal\"]' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Foto layar \"Rincian Tagihan\" (mis. Kartu Kredit/PayLater) — item yang tercentang akan diimpor jadi Tagihan baru. PAYMENT/PEMBAYARAN/E-STATEMENT otomatis tidak tercentang (biasanya bukan tagihan), cek ulang dulu sebelum impor.</div>\n    <div id=\"billMultiScanBody\"><div class=\"empty\"><div class=\"empty-icon\">📋</div><div class=\"empty-text\">Belum ada item terbaca. Scan foto rincian tagihan dulu.</div></div></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" style=\"margin-top:12px\" data-action=\"BillMultiScan.importSelected\">✅ Impor yang Dicentang</button>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"universalOcrModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"universalOcrModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"universalOcrModal-title\"><span>📷 Scan Universal Akun</span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"universalOcrModal\"]' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Foto layar aplikasi Bank/E-Wallet/Bibit/Jago (Kantong) — jenis layar & akun otomatis dikenali, item yang tercentang akan diimpor/diupdate ke 🏦 Akun. Cek dulu nama & saldonya sebelum impor, terutama kalau ada beberapa akun sekaligus (mis. layar Kantong Jago).</div>\n    <div id=\"universalOcrBody\"><div class=\"empty\"><div class=\"empty-icon\">📷</div><div class=\"empty-text\">Belum ada akun terbaca. Scan foto layar Bank/E-Wallet/Bibit/Jago dulu.</div></div></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full u-p14\" style=\"margin-top:12px\" data-action=\"UniversalScan.importSelected\">✅ Impor yang Dicentang</button>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"fuelBarCorrectionModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"fuelBarCorrectionModal-title\">\n  <div class=\"modal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-handle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"fuelBarCorrectionModal-title\"><span>⛽ Sinkronkan dengan Speedometer — <span id=\"fbcVehName\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\"></span></span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"fuelBarCorrectionModal\"]' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div>\n    <div class=\"u-hint12\">Pilih jumlah bar yang saat ini terlihat pada indikator bensin kendaraan. Koreksi ini hanya memperbaiki estimasi BBM saat ini — riwayat transaksi BBM tidak akan diubah.</div>\n    <div style=\"background:var(--surface3);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:14px;text-align:center\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;font-weight:700\">Estimasi Aplikasi</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);margin-top:4px\" id=\"fbcCurrentBarLabel\">- / - Bar</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:4px\" id=\"fbcCurrentLiterLabel\">- Liter</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:2px\" id=\"fbcCurrentPercentLabel\">-%</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Bar Sesungguhnya (Speedometer)</label>\n      <div id=\"fbcBarPicker\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column-reverse;gap:6px\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"fbcPreviewBox\" style=\"display:none;background:var(--accent-soft);border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:14px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px\"><span class=\"u-t2\">Sebelum</span><span class=\"u-fw700\" id=\"fbcBeforeLiter\">-</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px\"><span class=\"u-t2\">Sesudah</span><span style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)\" id=\"f