></div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Bayar dari Akun</label><select class=\"fs\" id=\"servisAcc\"></select></div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Gunakan Stok Sparepart (opsional)</label><select class=\"fs\" id=\"servisPartId\" onchange=\"onServisPartChange()\"><option value=\"\">Tidak pakai stok</option></select></div>\n    <div class=\"fg u-dnone\" id=\"servisPartQtyWrap\"><label class=\"fl\">Jumlah Terpakai</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"fi\" id=\"servisPartQty\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" value=\"1\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Part dari Vehicle Catalog (opsional)</label><select class=\"fs\" id=\"servisCatalogPartId\" onchange=\"onServisCatalogPartChange()\"><option value=\"\">Tidak pakai part katalog</option></select></div>\n    <div class=\"fg u-dnone\" id=\"servisCatalogPartQtyWrap\"><label class=\"fl\">Jumlah Part (Katalog)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"fi\" id=\"servisCatalogPartQty\" min=\"1\" step=\"any\" value=\"1\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fg u-dnone\" id=\"servisCatalogPartialWrap\" style=\"background:var(--accent-soft);border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.5\">🔎 Part katalog mirip ditemukan (bukan exact match) — pilih kalau memang ini yang dipakai, biar stok ikut otomatis kepotong:</div><div id=\"servisCatalogPartialList\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" data-action=\"Servis.dismissPartialCatalogMatch\">Bukan ini, abaikan</button></div>\n    <div class=\"fg u-dnone\" id=\"servisCatalogRecoWrap\"><label class=\"fl\">\ud83d\udca1 Rekomendasi Part dari Katalog</label><div id=\"servisCatalogRecoList\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px\"></div></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-full\" style=\"padding:14px;margin-bottom:8px\" data-action=\"saveServis\">Simpan</button>\n    <butt