lass=\"btn-row\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args='[\"fuelBarCorrectionModal\"]'>Batal</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"fbcSaveBtn\" data-action=\"FuelBarCorrection.save\" disabled>Simpan</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>", "<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"fuelTankProfileModal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"fuelTankProfileModal-title\"><div class=\"modal\"><div class=\"modal-handle\"></div><div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"fuelTankProfileModal-title\"><span>⛽ Atur Tangki — <span id=\"ftpVehName\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\"></span></span><button class=\"modal-close\" data-action=\"closeModal\" data-args=\'[\"fuelTankProfileModal\"]\' aria-label=\"Tutup\">✕</button></div><div class=\"u-hint12\">Profil tangki dipakai untuk menghitung estimasi bar/persen BBM & fitur Koreksi Speedometer. Kapasitas tangki wajib diisi; sisanya opsional (dipakai nilai bawaan kalau kosong).</div><div id=\"ftpFromCorrectionHint\" style=\"display:none;background:var(--accent-soft);border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.5\">💡 Simpan dulu profil tangki di sini — setelah tersimpan, modal Koreksi Speedometer akan otomatis lanjut terbuka lagi.</div><div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Kapasitas Tangki (Liter)</label><input type=\"number\" step=\"0.1\" class=\"fi\" id=\"ftpCapacity\" placeholder=\"4.2\" inputmode=\"decimal\"></div><div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Jumlah Bar Indikator BBM</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"fi\" id=\"ftpBarCount\" placeholder=\"8\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></div><div class=\"fg\"><label class=\"fl\">Cadangan Tangki / Reserve (Liter, opsional)</label><input type=\"number\" step=\"0.1\" class=\"fi\" id=\"ftpReserve\" placeholder=\"0\" inputmode=\"decimal\"></div><div class=\"fg u-mb0\"><label class=\"fl\">Jenis BBM Default (opsional)</label><input type=\"text\" class=\"fi\" id=\"