e Produsen</div>\n<div id=\"ongkirProdusenPrefHint\" class=\"u-fs11 u-t2 u-mb6\" style=\"line-height:1.5\"></div>\n<div class=\"u-grid2 u-mb8\"><div class=\"fg u-mb0\"><label class=\"fl\">Jarak (km, PP)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"fi\" id=\"ongkirKmProdusen\" placeholder=\"20\" inputmode=\"numeric\" oninput=\"OngkirCalc.calc()\"></div><div class=\"fg u-mb0\"><label class=\"fl\">Ongkos/km (Rp)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"fi\" id=\"ongkirBiayaProdusen\" placeholder=\"3000\" inputmode=\"numeric\" oninput=\"OngkirCalc.calc()\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:right;margin:-4px 0 8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;font-weight:600\" data-action=\"OngkirCalc.saveProdusenPref\">💾 Simpan sbg rute tetap Produsen ini</span></div>\n<div class=\"u-fs11 u-ctext3 u-mb6\" style=\"font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px\">Etape 2 · Pekalongan → Rumah Konsumen</div>\n<div class=\"u-grid2 u-mb8\" id=\"ongkirEtape2Fields\"><div class=\"fg u-mb0\"><label class=\"fl\">Jarak (km, PP)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"fi\" id=\"ongkirKmKonsumen\" placeholder=\"10\" inputmode=\"numeric\" oninput=\"OngkirCalc.calc()\"></div><div class=\"fg u-mb0\"><label class=\"fl\">Ongkos/km (Rp)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"fi\" id=\"ongkirBiayaKonsumen\" placeholder=\"3000\" inputmode=\"numeric\" oninput=\"OngkirCalc.calc()\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"fg u-mb8\"><label class=\"fl\">Jumlah Pcs Diangkut (sekali jalan)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"fi\" id=\"ongkirPcs\" placeholder=\"20\" inputmode=\"numeric\" oninput=\"OngkirCalc.calc()\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:var(--surface3);border-radius:10px;padding:10px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px\"><div style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;font-weight:700\">Biaya Angkut / Pcs</div><div style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)\" id=\"ongkirRes